This project tests implementations of the x402 protocol (https://github.com/x402-foundation/x402). It contains no code
from that project. Its error codes, field names and the spec text quoted in docs/SPEC.md come from its public
specification, for reference; the check identifiers (S0, P1, F1, R0, C1 and the rest) are this project's own.
